ription":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-07-27T10:46:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T23:09:25Z","closed_at":"2025-10-01T23:07:59Z","assignee":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Tested: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 10 Jul 2025 15:37:43 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Mesa Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620 (KBL GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8350U CPU @ 1.70GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen attaching a RigidBody3D to a Generic6DOFJoint3D, the joint unexpectedly rotates when enabling `axis_lock_angular_x` or `axis_lock_angular_y` on the RigidBody3D. This happens when using the Jolt physics engine, but operates as expected when using Godot physics.\n\nHere is a screenshot of the attached MRP:\n<img width=\"1918\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e38b08fd-8516-4908-935a-e771962f2be3\" />\nRectangle RigidBody3D on the left. Rectangle StaticBody3D to the right. Sphere StaticBody3D at the bottom to test rotational movement/lock. Selected Generic6DOFJoint3D is positioned on the left side of the static body.\n\nExpected. The RigidBody3D remains suspended above the sphere on a non-rotating joint.\n<img width=\"1147\" height=\"652\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/add82afd-c2eb-461d-aabf-5d3b5b368da0\" />\n\nActual. The RigidBody3D is somehow free to rotate in the Z axis.\n<img width=\"1135\" height=\"636\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d798551-8330-4248-b37a-7276c000f292\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Enable Jolt physics in the project settings.\n- Create 3D scene.\n- Add RigidBody3D (with some collision and mesh).\n  - Enable `axis_lock_angular_x` and `axis_lock_angular_y`\n  - Move off-origin along the X axis a meter or two.\n- Add Generic6DOFJoint3D (with all default settings).\n  - Set `node_a` to the rigid body from above.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Archive.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21453444/Archive.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109018/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109018/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}